      "start_seconds": 4.46,
      "end_seconds": 10.54,
      "duration_seconds": 6.08,
      "text": "oh, hello, doctor. I'm here with them in case I can help"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 12.21,
      "end_seconds": 15.2,
      "duration_seconds": 2.99,
      "text": "Did you find the the place alright?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 16.95,
      "end_seconds": 23.96,
      "duration_seconds": 7.01,
      "text": "yes you know it was easy enough the parking was the hard part"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 25.14,
      "end_seconds": 28.44,
      "duration_seconds": 3.3,
      "text": "What would you like to start with today?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "FAMILY_MEMBER",
      "start_seconds": 30.41,
      "end_seconds": 36.88,
      "duration_seconds": 6.47,
      "text": "he's been having itchy red patches that have gone crusty, doctor"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 38.91,
      "end_seconds": 42.43,
      "duration_seconds": 3.52,
      "text": "When was the first time you noticed it?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 43.83,
      "end_seconds": 47.27,
      "duration_seconds": 3.44,
      "text": "For about a week, I'd say."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 49.34,
      "end_seconds": 57.83,
      "duration_seconds": 8.49,
      "text": "can you describe it a bit more for me? How strong it is, what the pattern is, what helps"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 59.0,
      "end_seconds": 84.05,
      "duration_seconds": 25.05,
      "text": "Okay so it sort of comes and goes. It feels mild to me. It's a relief to finally sit down and talk about it. Yeah uh I've had being irritable too for two weeks. Actually there was scratching at night yes but that went away."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 84.98,
      "end_seconds": 87.6,
      "duration_seconds": 2.62,
      "text": "has there been any high fever?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 88.47,
      "end_seconds": 90.91,
      "duration_seconds": 2.44,
      "text": "no high fever, thankfully"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 91.53,
      "end_seconds": 94.1,
      "duration_seconds": 2.57,
      "text": "Any eating poorly, drowsiness or blisters?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 95.95,
      "end_seconds": 100.97,
      "duration_seconds": 5.02,
      "text": "I mean, no, none that that I've noticed"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 101.62,
      "end_seconds": 105.77,
      "duration_seconds": 4.15,
      "text": "any change in your bowel habit or your stomach generally?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 106.78,
      "end_seconds": 110.78,
      "duration_seconds": 4.0,
      "text": "well no that that side's been fine"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 114.29,
      "end_seconds": 117.17,
      "duration_seconds": 2.88,
      "text": "Okay, anything different when you pass water?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 118.96,
      "end_seconds": 120.61,
      "duration_seconds": 1.65,
      "text": "nothing there, no"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 121.22,
      "end_seconds": 124.48,
      "duration_seconds": 3.26,
      "text": "any past operations I should know about?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 125.07,
      "end_seconds": 129.75,
      "duration_seconds": 4.68,
      "text": "I, I had my tonsils removed as a teenager"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 130.94,
      "end_seconds": 132.89,
      "duration_seconds": 1.95,
      "text": "let's run through your medicines"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 134.96,
      "end_seconds": 138.96,
      "duration_seconds": 4.0,
      "text": "Hydrocortisone cream. I take it when needed"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 140.75,
      "end_seconds": 143.84,
      "duration_seconds": 3.09,
      "text": "How long have you been on it?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 145.13,
      "end_seconds": 160.05,
      "duration_seconds": 14.92,
      "text": "Nearly five years now. Tiotropium inhaler. I take it once a day for my chest. I've been putting this off for weeks. I take a moisturiser, twice a day."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 160.93,
      "end_seconds": 164.43,
      "duration_seconds": 3.5,
      "text": "anything in your past medical history I should know?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 165.49,
      "end_seconds": 168.05,
      "duration_seconds": 2.56,
      "text": "Eczema, for nearly five years."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 169.45,
      "end_seconds": 170.42,
      "duration_seconds": 0.97,
      "text": "I follow."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 171.02,
      "end_seconds": 183.42,
      "duration_seconds": 12.4,
      "text": "actually, yes, COPD. I did try to ignore it for a while. I took the morning off to come in today"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 184.23,
      "end_seconds": 188.82,
      "duration_seconds": 4.59,
      "text": "yes, eczema is known to us, good to have that clear"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 197.08,
      "end_seconds": 199.04,
      "duration_seconds": 1.96,
      "text": "is there someone at home?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 199.65,
      "end_seconds": 203.58,
      "duration_seconds": 3.93,
      "text": "My husband and I live above the shop."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 204.42,
      "end_seconds": 207.6,
      "duration_seconds": 3.18,
      "text": "What do you do during the the day?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 208.68,
      "end_seconds": 212.36,
      "duration_seconds": 3.68,
      "text": "I look after my grandchildren most days."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 213.49,
      "end_seconds": 217.67,
      "duration_seconds": 4.18,
      "text": "what does a normal day of food look like?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 219.27,
      "end_seconds": 223.16,
      "duration_seconds": 3.89,
      "text": "Lots of rice, lentils and some fruit."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 233.32,
      "end_seconds": 238.68,
      "duration_seconds": 5.36,
      "text": "Has anything ever caused you a reaction? I mean any allergies."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0037",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 239.61,
      "end_seconds": 242.02,
      "duration_seconds": 2.41,
      "text": "no allergies at all"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0038",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "FAMILY_MEMBER",
      "start_seconds": 243.92,
      "end_seconds": 253.88,
      "duration_seconds": 9.96,
      "text": "actually, I remember he had some kind of reaction to tramadol before i couldn't swear to it"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0039",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 254.72,
      "end_seconds": 257.52,
      "duration_seconds": 2.8,
      "text": "I I don't remember that"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0040",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 258.85,
      "end_seconds": 261.69,
      "duration_seconds": 2.84,
      "text": "okay, I'll note both of those"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0041",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "NURSE",
      "start_seconds": 263.23,
      "end_seconds": 272.53,
      "duration_seconds": 9.3,
      "text": "Okay, so the vitals from earlier. Pulse is 74 beats a minute, blood pressure 112 over 80, temp 36.6 degrees."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0042",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 276.49,
      "end_seconds": 277.19,
      "duration_seconds": 0.7,
      "text": "thanks"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0043",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 279.48,
      "end_seconds": 281.7,
      "duration_seconds": 2.22,
      "text": "shall I start the examination?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0044",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 283.28,
      "end_seconds": 284.56,
      "duration_seconds": 1.28,
      "text": "nearly finished here"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0045",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 302.59,
      "end_seconds": 307.4,
      "duration_seconds": 4.81,
      "text": "The eczema patches on the arms have yellow crusts and weeping areas."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0046",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 310.78,
      "end_seconds": 320.7,
      "duration_seconds": 9.92,
      "text": "okay, that's enough for me okay, thinking it through, I'd lean towards eczema with a bacterial skin infection another possibility is herpes simplex eczema"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0047",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 321.82,
      "end_seconds": 326.39,
      "duration_seconds": 4.57,
      "text": "So So I'm scared it's something bad. Is it?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0048",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 327.49,
      "end_seconds": 335.57,
      "duration_seconds": 8.08,
      "text": "Nothing I've seen today points to an emergency. It looks like eczema with a bacterial skin infection."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0049",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 349.61,
      "end_seconds": 357.38,
      "duration_seconds": 7.77,
      "text": "keep the nails short and keep using the moisturiser. Is there anything you'd like me to go over again?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0050",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 359.06,
      "end_seconds": 362.44,
      "duration_seconds": 3.38,
      "text": "uh, thank you, that's helpful"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0051",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 363.79,
      "end_seconds": 365.44,
      "duration_seconds": 1.65,
